  <item>
    <title>Vol.1 你为何会痛苦 |《佛教的见地与修道》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62d122a192f0689a31f5012d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62d122a192f0689a31f5012d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 Jul 2022 08:17:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们所身处的这个时代，有着各式各样的焦虑和痛苦。学生有升学的焦虑，大学生有从学生过渡到职场人的焦虑，中产阶级有悬浮状态的焦虑，父母有鸡娃的焦虑……</span></p><p><span>我们好像总在渴求着什么，热爱做计划，当下的每一瞬都被那远未到来的目标牺牲掉了，在目标达成的那一刻，我们获得了片刻的喘息和快乐，而后又马不停蹄地奔往下一个目标……</span></p><p><span>问题是，我们真的快乐，真的幸福吗？</span></p><p><span>本期内容聚焦于《佛教的见地与修道》这本书的上篇——“见地”，试图站在佛学的框架内，解构痛苦的根源，从而揭露出我们平时难以察觉到的，但它又在反复触及我们意识神经的，深层的痛苦。</span></p><ul><li><p><span>节目时间线</span></p></li></ul><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">1:45</a> 节目介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">3:30</a> 宗萨蒋扬钦哲仁波切</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a> 《佛教的见地与修道》结构概要</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">7:24</a> 见地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 自我是幻觉</span></p><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="836">13:56</a> 同一性问题</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a> 空性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 四圣谛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">32:03</a> 业力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2096">34:56</a> 转世再生</span></p><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2140">35:40</a> 身心问题</span></p></blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 佛性</span></p><p><span>BGM:</span></p><p><span>林生祥—面会菜</span></p><p><span>音频文字版可关注微信同名公众号“见地剧场”</span></p><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/H0ukzOIjSBIIW-y7cZmnGg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/H0ukzOIjSBIIW-y7cZmnGg"><span>mp.weixin.qq.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
